---
const { apiUrl, recaptchaSiteKey, context = 'standalone', registrationId = '' } = Astro.props;
const isFlow = context === 'flow';
---

<div class="waiver-form waiver-print-area mt-6">
  <p class="waiver-banner rounded-lg bg-red-700 px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold text-white" role="alert">
    Please read the document carefully.
  </p>

  <div class="waiver-doc mt-4 rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-taupe">Solker RD Company Inc</p>
    <p class="waiver-main-title mt-1 text-base font-bold text-white">RELEASE OF LIABILITY, WAIVER OF CLAIMS AND ASSUMPTION OF RISKS</p>
    <p class="waiver-warning mt-2 border-b border-taupe/30 pb-3 font-bold text-orange">
      BY SIGNING THIS DOCUMENT, YOU WAIVE CERTAIN LEGAL RIGHTS, INCLUDING THE RIGHT TO SUE. PLEASE READ CAREFULLY.
    </p>

    <section class="waiver-section mt-3">
      <p class="font-bold text-white">1. AWARENESS AND ASSUMPTION OF RISK</p>
      <p class="mt-1">
        I am aware that participating in the sports leagues, events, and activities organized by Solker RD Company Inc. (known as &ldquo;Solker&rdquo;) involves inherent risks, including but not limited to: physical injury, collisions, equipment failure, facility hazards, weather conditions, and the transmission of communicable diseases. I acknowledge that these risks may result in personal injury, death, property damage, or loss of income. I freely accept and fully assume all such risks, including those arising from the <strong>NEGLIGENCE</strong>, breach of contract, or breach of any statutory or other duty of care (including any duty of care owed under the Occupiers&apos; Liability Act of Ontario) of Solker, its directors, officers, employees, volunteers, and facility owners (collectively <strong>&ldquo;The Organization&rdquo;</strong>).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="waiver-section mt-3">
      <p class="font-bold text-white">2. RELEASE OF LIABILITY AND INDEMNITY</p>
      <p class="mt-1">In consideration of being permitted to participate, I agree:</p>
      <ul class="ml-5 mt-1 list-disc space-y-1">
        <li><strong>TO WAIVE ANY AND ALL CLAIMS</strong> that I have or may have in the future against the Organization.</li>
        <li><strong>TO RELEASE THE ORGANIZATION</strong> from any and all liability for any loss, damage, or injury&mdash;including death&mdash;that I or my next of kin may suffer due to any cause whatsoever, including <strong>NEGLIGENCE</strong>, breach of contract, or breach of any statutory duty of care.</li>
        <li><strong>TO INDEMNIFY AND HOLD HARMLESS</strong> the Organization from any and all liability for damage to property of, or personal injury to, any third party resulting from my participation.</li>
        <li><strong>BINDING EFFECT:</strong> This agreement is binding upon my heirs, next of kin, executors, and representatives.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="waiver-section mt-3">
      <p class="font-bold text-white">3. LEAGUE RULES AND CONSENT</p>
      <ul class="ml-5 mt-1 list-disc space-y-1">
        <li><strong>CONDUCT &amp; EQUIPMENT:</strong> I agree to abide by all league rules. I understand that failure to comply with these rules, failing to meet the expectations of the league, or engaging in any physical or mental abuse will result in immediate expulsion without a refund. Furthermore, I am solely responsible for providing and wearing my own protective equipment.</li>
        <li><strong>MEDICAL &amp; MEDIA:</strong> In the event of an emergency, I consent to medical treatment at my own expense. I also grant the Organization permission to use my image or likeness for promotional purposes without compensation, understanding that I may withdraw this media consent in writing at any time.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="waiver-section mt-3">
      <p class="font-bold text-white">4. ACKNOWLEDGEMENT</p>
      <p class="mt-1">I warrant that I am physically fit to participate and 18 years of age or older. I have read and understand this agreement. I am aware that by signing below, I am waiving substantial legal rights which I or my heirs may have against the Organization.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="waiver-no-print mt-4 text-sm text-taupe">All fields marked with <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">*</span> are required (agreement, full name, email, and signature) before submission.</p>
  <form id="waiver-form" class="mt-4 space-y-4" novalidate>
    <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
      <input type="checkbox" id="waiverAgreement" name="agreement" required class="mt-1 h-[18px] w-[18px] accent-orange" />
      <label for="waiverAgreement" class="cursor-pointer text-white"><span class="text-red-500">*</span> I have read and understand this agreement, am 18 years of age or older, and agree to the terms above.</label>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="waiverFullName" class="mb-1 block font-medium text-white"><span class="text-red-500">*</span> Full Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="waiverFullName" name="fullName" required maxlength="150" placeholder="Your full name" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark px-4 py-2 text-white placeholder:text-taupe/60 focus:border-orange focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-orange" />
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="waiverEmail" class="mb-1 block font-medium text-white"><span class="text-red-500">*</span> Email Address</label>
      <input type="email" id="waiverEmail" name="email" required maxlength="254" placeholder="you@example.com" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark px-4 py-2 text-white placeholder:text-taupe/60 focus:border-orange focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-orange" />
    </div>

    <div>
      <label class="mb-1 block font-medium text-white"><span class="text-red-500">*</span> Draw Signature</label>
      <div class="signature-wrapper mx-auto max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-[#F0F5F1]">
        <canvas id="waiverSignatureCanvas" class="signature-canvas block w-full touch-none" width="400" height="160"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="signature-actions mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <button type="button" id="waiverClearBtn" class="btn-clear rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sage-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange">Clear Signature</button>
        <button type="button" id="waiverPrintBtn" class="btn-print rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sage-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange">Print Page</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="waiver-dated text-sm text-white/70" id="waiverDate">Dated: <span id="waiverDateValue"></span></p>

    <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
      <input type="checkbox" id="waiverEmailCopy" name="emailCopy" class="mt-1 h-[18px] w-[18px] accent-orange" />
      <label for="waiverEmailCopy" class="cursor-pointer text-white">Send me a copy of the waiver by email</label>
    </div>

    <div id="waiver-recaptcha-wrap" class="flex justify-center"></div>

    <button type="submit" id="waiverSubmitBtn" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-orange px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-orange-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70">
      Submit Waiver
    </button>
    <button type="button" id="waiverMockSubmitBtn" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sage-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70">
      Mocky Submit Waiver
    </button>
  </form>

  <div id="waiverStatusMessage" class="mt-4 min-h-[1.5em] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center font-medium" aria-live="polite">
    <span id="waiverStatusSpinner" class="submit-spinner h-10 w-10 rounded-full border-2 border-sage-dark border-t-orange" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;"></span>
    <span id="waiverStatusText"></span>
    {!isFlow && (
      <div id="waiverSuccessActions" class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-2 mt-2" style="display: none;">
        <button type="button" id="resetWaiverBtn" class="rounded-lg border border-taupe/30 bg-forest-dark px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sage-dark focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange">Reset form</button>
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .signature-wrapper { width: 100%; }
  .signature-canvas { width: 100%; height: 160px; max-width: 400px; }
  .submit-spinner {
    border-top-color: var(--theme-orange);
    animation: submit-spin 0.8s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes submit-spin {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }
  @media print {
    :global(body *) { visibility: hidden; }
    :global(.waiver-print-area), :global(.waiver-print-area *) { visibility: visible; }
    :global(.waiver-print-area) { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; max-width: none; }
    :global(.waiver-print-area) .waiver-banner, :global(.waiver-print-area) .btn-clear, :global(.waiver-print-area) .btn-print, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiverSubmitBtn, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiverMockSubmitBtn, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiver-recaptcha-wrap, :global(.waiver-print-area) .signature-actions, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiverClearBtn, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiverPrintBtn, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiverEmailCopy, :global(.waiver-print-area) label[for="waiverEmailCopy"], :global(.waiver-print-area) .waiver-no-print, :global(.waiver-print-area) #waiverStatusMessage { display: none !important; }
    :global(.waiver-print-area) .waiver-doc, :global(.waiver-print-area) .signature-wrapper { border: 1px solid #ccc; }
  }
</style>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/signature_pad@4.1.7/dist/signature_pad.umd.min.js" />
<script src="https://www.google.com/recaptcha/api.js?onload=onRecaptchaLoadWaiverForm&render=explicit" async defer />
<script define:vars={{ apiUrl, recaptchaSiteKey, isFlow, registrationId }}>
  (function() {
    var waiverDateEl = document.getElementById('waiverDateValue');
    if (waiverDateEl) {
      var d = new Date();
      waiverDateEl.textContent = d.getFullYear() + '/' + String(d.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0') + '/' + String(d.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');
    }

    var signaturePad = null;

    function initSignaturePad() {
      var canvas = document.getElementById('waiverSignatureCanvas');
      if (!canvas || typeof SignaturePad === 'undefined') return;
      var w = canvas.offsetWidth || 400;
      var h = canvas.offsetHeight || 160;
      canvas.width = w;
      canvas.height = h;
      signaturePad = new SignaturePad(canvas, { penColor: 'rgb(13, 13, 13)' });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initSignaturePad);
    } else {
      initSignaturePad();
    }

    document.addEventListener('click', function clearBtnHandler(ev) {
      if (ev.target && ev.target.id === 'waiverClearBtn' && signaturePad) signaturePad.clear();
    });
    document.addEventListener('click', function printBtnHandler(ev) {
      if (ev.target && ev.target.id === 'waiverPrintBtn') window.print();
    });

    var recaptchaWidgetId = null;
    window.onRecaptchaLoadWaiverForm = function() {
      if (typeof grecaptcha === 'undefined' || !recaptchaSiteKey) return;
      var wrap = document.getElementById('waiver-recaptcha-wrap');
      if (wrap) recaptchaWidgetId = grecaptcha.render(wrap, { sitekey: recaptchaSiteKey, theme: 'dark' });
    };

    var form = document.getElementById('waiver-form');
    if (form) {
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        var agreement = form.querySelector('#waiverAgreement');
        var fullName = (form.querySelector('#waiverFullName') && form.querySelector('#waiverFullName').value) ? form.querySelector('#waiverFullName').value.trim() : '';
        var email = (form.querySelector('#waiverEmail') && form.querySelector('#waiverEmail').value) ? form.querySelector('#waiverEmail').value.trim() : '';
        var statusSpinner = document.getElementById('waiverStatusSpinner');
        var statusText = document.getElementById('waiverStatusText');
        var submitBtn = document.getElementById('waiverSubmitBtn');

        if (!agreement || !agreement.checked) {
          if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
          if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Please confirm that you have read and agree to the waiver.';
          return;
        }
        if (!fullName || !email) {
          if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
          if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Please fill in your name and email.';
          return;
        }
        var emailRegex = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/;
        if (!emailRegex.test(email)) {
          if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
          if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Please enter a valid email address.';
          return;
        }
        if (!signaturePad || signaturePad.isEmpty()) {
          if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
          if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Please provide a signature.';
          return;
        }
        var token = '';
        if (typeof grecaptcha !== 'undefined' && recaptchaSiteKey && recaptchaWidgetId !== null) {
          token = grecaptcha.getResponse(recaptchaWidgetId);
          if (!token) {
            if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
            if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Please complete the verification below.';
            return;
          }
        }

        if (!apiUrl) {
          if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
          if (statusText) statusText.textContent = 'Form is not configured. Set PUBLIC_FORMS_API_URL.';
          return;
        }

        submitBtn.disabled = true;
        if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'block';
        if (statusText) { statusText.textContent = 'Verifying and submitting…'; statusText.classList.remove('text-red-500', 'text-green-600'); }

        var dateSignedEl = document.getElementById('waiverDateValue');
        var dateSigned = dateSignedEl ? dateSignedEl.textContent : new Date().toLocaleDateString();
        var emailCopyEl = form.querySelector('#waiverEmailCopy');
        var data = {
          name: fullName,
          email: email,
          signatureData: signaturePad.toDataURL('image/png'),
          dateSigned: dateSigned,
          emailCopy: !!(emailCopyEl && emailCopyEl.checked)
        };
        if (isFlow && (typeof window.__registrationFlowId !== 'undefined' && window.__registrationFlowId)) data.registrationId = window.__registrationFlowId;
        else if (!isFlow) data.registrationId = typeof crypto !== 'undefined' && crypto.randomUUID ? crypto.randomUUID() : '';

        var payload = { action: 'waiver', data: data, recaptchaToken: token };

        fetch(apiUrl, {
          method: 'POST',
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'text/plain;charset=utf-8' },
          redirect: 'follow'
        })
          .then(function(res) { return res.json(); })
          .then(function(json) {
            if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
            if (json.success) {
              if (statusText) { statusText.textContent = json.message || 'Success!'; statusText.classList.add('text-green-600'); }
              submitBtn.style.display = 'none';
              var recWrap = document.getElementById('waiver-recaptcha-wrap');
              if (recWrap) recWrap.innerHTML = '';
              var successActions = document.getElementById('waiverSuccessActions');
              if (successActions) successActions.style.display = 'flex';
              if (isFlow && typeof window.__openRegistrationCompleteModal === 'function') {
                window.__openRegistrationCompleteModal();
              }
            } else {
              if (statusText) { statusText.textContent = json.error || 'Something went wrong.'; statusText.classList.add('text-red-500'); }
              submitBtn.disabled = false;
            }
          })
          .catch(function(err) {
            if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
            if (statusText) { statusText.textContent = err.message || 'Network error. Please try again.'; statusText.classList.add('text-red-500'); }
            submitBtn.disabled = false;
          });
      });
    }

    var resetWaiverBtn = document.getElementById('resetWaiverBtn');
    if (resetWaiverBtn) resetWaiverBtn.addEventListener('click', function() { location.reload(); });

    var waiverMockBtn = document.getElementById('waiverMockSubmitBtn');
    if (waiverMockBtn) {
      waiverMockBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        var statusSpinner = document.getElementById('waiverStatusSpinner');
        var statusText = document.getElementById('waiverStatusText');
        var submitBtn = document.getElementById('waiverSubmitBtn');
        var successActions = document.getElementById('waiverSuccessActions');
        if (!statusText) return;
        waiverMockBtn.disabled = true;
        if (submitBtn) submitBtn.style.display = 'none';
        if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'block';
        statusText.textContent = 'Verifying and submitting…';
        statusText.classList.remove('text-red-500', 'text-green-600');
        window.setTimeout(function() {
          if (statusSpinner) statusSpinner.style.display = 'none';
          statusText.textContent = 'Success! Your waiver has been submitted.';
          statusText.classList.add('text-green-600');
          var recWrap = document.getElementById('waiver-recaptcha-wrap');
          if (recWrap) recWrap.innerHTML = '';
          if (successActions) successActions.style.display = 'flex';
          if (isFlow && typeof window.__openRegistrationCompleteModal === 'function') {
            window.__openRegistrationCompleteModal();
          }
          waiverMockBtn.disabled = false;
        }, 1500);
      });
    }
  })();
</script>
